    wifi1 --> scale["Smart Scale"]
    phones ~~~ ereaders
    laptops ~~~ watches
    tablets ~~~ scale
    wifi1 -. "WDS Bridge" .-> wifi2["Bridge Router<br/>wifi2 · Flint 2"]

    wifi2 --> homeserver["homeserver"]
