    wifi2 --> framework["fwai0"]
    homeserver ~~~ pi
    xps ~~~ framework

    classDef internet fill:#d8f3dc,stroke:#1b4332,stroke-width:2px,color:#1b4332;
    classDef network fill:#d4f1f9,stroke:#05445e,stroke-width:2px,color:#05445e;
    classDef client fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#6b21a8,stroke-width:2px,color:#581c87;
